late is a Markdown file located under the /workspace directory called template.md, and the list of requirement is in a txt file called requirement.txt also under the /workspace directory. \\n     2\\t\\n     3\\t* You need to merge them and create a file called \"job_description.md\" on OwnCloud under the documents directory. You can navigate to OwnCloud through the url http://the-agent-company.com:8092. Make sure it is a Markdown file.\\n     4\\t* Create a share link to this file that is accessible to anyone. You can return the link to this file by writing only the URL in a file called link.txt and put it under the /workspace directory.\\n', path='/instruction/task.md', observation=<ObservationType.READ: 'read'>, impl_source='oh_aci'), CmdRunAction(command='ls -la /workspace', is_input=False, thought=\"Now I understand the task. I need to:\\n1. Find and read the template.md and requirement.txt files in /workspace\\n2. Merge them to create a job description\\n3. Upload the merged file to OwnCloud in the documents directory\\n4. Create a share link and save it to link.txt\\n\\nLet me first check what's in the /workspace directory and locate the required files.\", blocking=False, is_static=False, cwd=None, hidden=False, action=<ActionType.RUN: 'run'>, confirmation_state='confirmed', security_risk=None), CmdOutputObservation(content='total 16\\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root 4096 Dec 16  2024 .\\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root 4096 Nov 11 02:54 ..\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 1467 Dec 16  2024 requirement.txt\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 2375 Dec 16  2024 template.md', command='ls -la /workspace', observation=<ObservationType.RUN: 'run'>, metadata=CmdOutputMetadata(exit_code=0, pid=-1, username='root', hostname='ecs-d984', working_dir='/outputs', py_interpreter_path='/openhands/poetry/openhands-ai-5O4_aCHf-py3.12/bin/python', prefix='', suffix='\\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]'), hidden=False), FileReadAction(path='/workspace/template.md', start=0, end=-1, thought='Great! I found