ondensationAction(action=<ActionType.CONDENSATION: 'condensation'>, forgotten_event_ids=None, forgotten_events_start_id=5, forgotten_events_end_id=34, summary=None, summary_offset=None), MCPAction(name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'OwnCloud', 'operation': 'UploadFileAndCreateShareLink', 'details': '# Upload File and Create Share Link in OwnCloud\\n\\n## Overview\\nThis SOP describes how to upload a file to OwnCloud and create a publicly accessible share link.\\n\\n## Prerequisites\\n- OwnCloud instance access (username: theagentcompany, password: theagentcompany)\\n- File to upload (e.g., job_description.md)\\n\\n## Steps\\n\\n### 1. Navigate to Documents Directory\\n- Access OwnCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n- Navigate to the Documents directory\\n\\n### 2. Upload File via WebDAV (Alternative Method)\\nWhen browser upload fails due to hidden file inputs, use WebDAV:\\n```bash\\ncurl -u theagentcompany:theagentcompany -T /workspace/job_description.md \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\"\\n```\\n\\n### 3. Create Public Share Link\\n1. Click on the file\\'s \"Share\" button\\n2. Navigate to \"Public Links\" tab\\n3. Click \"Create public link\"\\n4. In the dialog, keep default settings (Download/View permissions)\\n5. Click \"Share\" to create the link\\n\\n### 4. Access the Share Link\\n- The generated share link will appear in the Public Links section\\n- Example: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/D6pgMFLVS6zhwMA\\n- This link is accessible to anyone without authentication\\n\\n## Verification\\n- File appears in Documents directory with \"Shared\" status\\n- Public link is visible in Public Links section\\n- Link can be accessed by anyone to view/download the file\\n\\n## Troubleshooting\\n- If browser upload fails, use WebDAV method\\n- Ensure proper file permissions\\n- Verify network connectivity to OwnCloud instance'}, thought='Perfect! The public link has been success